# INERT. THIS FILE DOES NOTHING ON THIS PROJECT. DO NOT ADD RULES HERE.
#
# `_redirects` is ignored on this legacy `pages_build_output_dir` Pages
# project: it cannot 404 paths that exist as static assets, and
# functions/_middleware.ts rewrites the request before the asset server is
# reached. Proven ineffective live (`/wrangler.toml` and `/schema.sql` both
# returned 200 while listed below). See the deviations table in CLAUDE.md.
